        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've <strong>run the temple</strong>.<br>You've <strong>stolen the jetpack</strong>.<br>You've <strong>crossed the road</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you got what it takes to survive the biggest challenge ever!?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/b65803c61ebc331f11b39c77aa56b1c9.avif?t=1756949888\" width=616 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Cartoon Survivor</i>, you’ll face off against an unforgiving prehistoric world full of chaotic obstacles and feisty creatures across five worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 3D adventure runner is bursting with vibrant colours, wild action, and creatures of all shapes and sizes. Encounter rampaging dinosaurs and towering mammoths to sneaky tigers and slithering snakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/a3d9fe4df3b3ce876956836a4c924e79.poster.avif?t=1756949888\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/a3d9fe4df3b3ce876956836a4c924e79.webm?t=1756949888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step could be your last, so you’ll need your wits—and some seriously impressive parkour skills—to stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer the most insane obstacle courses ever designed and bring the Cartoon Survivors’ ratings back from the brink? Your survival is the only thing standing between this show and total cancellation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/46da831472a1b67c106ff701035de1b7.avif?t=1756949888\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild, Colourful Worlds</strong>: Immerse yourself in a bright, cartoonish prehistoric landscape filled with danger, humour, and thrilling obstacles. Think you’ve seen it all? Think again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Obstacles</strong>: Run, leap, and glide through ever-changing environments and wild courses, each one more intense than the last. Can you make it to the end?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Characters</strong>: Follow in the clumsy, courageous footsteps of the latest cartoon hero. There's over 40 costumes to unlock and creative power-ups to help you along the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong>: Put your speed and reflexes to the test! Every run is different, collectable trophies in each level designed to keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/65cb4023c81cd451650bdf159aa90fe3.avif?t=1756949888\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cartoon Survivor Base Game Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World 1 and 2, Jurassic and Prehisteria</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All costumes and helmets are available to unlock with in-game coins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/ef4c0038d5d323996756bb9a550240a9.poster.avif?t=1756949888\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/ef4c0038d5d323996756bb9a550240a9.webm?t=1756949888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've <strong>run the temple</strong>.<br>You've <strong>stolen the jetpack</strong>.<br>You've <strong>crossed the road</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you got what it takes to survive the biggest challenge ever!?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/b65803c61ebc331f11b39c77aa56b1c9.avif?t=1756949888\" width=616 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Cartoon Survivor</i>, you’ll face off against an unforgiving prehistoric world full of chaotic obstacles and feisty creatures across five worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 3D adventure runner is bursting with vibrant colours, wild action, and creatures of all shapes and sizes. Encounter rampaging dinosaurs and towering mammoths to sneaky tigers and slithering snakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/a3d9fe4df3b3ce876956836a4c924e79.poster.avif?t=1756949888\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/a3d9fe4df3b3ce876956836a4c924e79.webm?t=1756949888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step could be your last, so you’ll need your wits—and some seriously impressive parkour skills—to stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer the most insane obstacle courses ever designed and bring the Cartoon Survivors’ ratings back from the brink? Your survival is the only thing standing between this show and total cancellation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/46da831472a1b67c106ff701035de1b7.avif?t=1756949888\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild, Colourful Worlds</strong>: Immerse yourself in a bright, cartoonish prehistoric landscape filled with danger, humour, and thrilling obstacles. Think you’ve seen it all? Think again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Obstacles</strong>: Run, leap, and glide through ever-changing environments and wild courses, each one more intense than the last. Can you make it to the end?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Characters</strong>: Follow in the clumsy, courageous footsteps of the latest cartoon hero. There's over 40 costumes to unlock and creative power-ups to help you along the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong>: Put your speed and reflexes to the test! Every run is different, collectable trophies in each level designed to keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/65cb4023c81cd451650bdf159aa90fe3.avif?t=1756949888\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cartoon Survivor Base Game Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World 1 and 2, Jurassic and Prehisteria</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All costumes and helmets are available to unlock with in-game coins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/ef4c0038d5d323996756bb9a550240a9.poster.avif?t=1756949888\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/ef4c0038d5d323996756bb9a550240a